/Crew%3A%2A%2A%0A%0A%2A%20%2A%2ADirector%3A%2A%2A%20James%20Cameron%0A%2A%20%2A%2AProducers%3A%2A%2A%20James%20Cameron%2C%20Jon%20Landau%0A%2A%20%2A%2ACast%3A%2A%2A%0A%09%2B%20Sam%20Worthington%20as%20Jake%20Sully%0A%09%2B%20Zoe%20Saldana%20as%20Neytiri%0A%09%2B%20Sigourney%20Weaver%20as%20Kiri%20%28Dr.%20Grace%20Augustine%27s%20adopted%20Na%27vi%20daughter%29%0A%09%2B%20Stephen%20Lang%20as%20Colonel%20Miles%20Quaritch%0A%09%2B%20Cliff%20Curtis%20as%20Tonowari%20%28Metkayina%20clan%20leader%29%0A%09%2B%20Joel%20David%20Moore%20as%20Dr.%20Norm%20Spellman%0A%09%2B%20CCH%20Pounder%20as%20Mo%27at%20%28Neytiri%27s%20mother%29%0A%09%2B%20Edie%20Falco%20as%20General%20Frances%20Ardmore%0A%09%2B%20Jemaine%20Clement%20as%20Dr.%20Ian%20Garvin%0A%09%2B%20Britain%20Dalton%20as%20Lo%27ak%20%28Jake%20and%20Neytiri%27s%20son%29%0A%09%2B%20Trinity%20Bliss%20as%20Tuktirey%20%28Jake%20and%20Neytiri%27s%20daughter%29%0A%09%2B%20Jeremy%20Irwin%20as%20Neteyam%20%28Jake%20and%20Neytiri%27s%20son%29%0A%09%2B%20Jack%20Champion%20as%20Miles%20Socorro%20%28Jake%20and%20Neytiri%27s%20adopted%20human%20son%29%0A%0A%2A%2ACritical%20Reception%3A%2A%2A%0A%2A%2AAvatar%3A%20The%20Way%20of%20Water%2A%2A%20has%20received%20widespread%20critical%20acclaim%20for%20its%20groundbreaking%20visual%20effects%2C%20immersive%20world-building%2C%20and%20engaging%20storyline.%20The%20film%20holds%20a%2095%25%20approval%20rating%20on%20Rotten%20Tomatoes%2C%20with%20many%20praising%20its%20stunning%20visuals%2C%20impressive%20action%20sequences%2C%20and%20strong%20performances%20from%20the%20cast.%0A%0A%2A%2ABox%20Office/Ratings%3A%2A%2A%0AThe%20film%20has%20been%20a%20massive%20commercial%20success%2C%20grossing%20over%20%242.32%20billion%20worldwide%2C%20making%20it%20the%20highest-grossing%20film%20of%202022%20and%20one%20of%20the%20highest-grossing%20films%20of%20all%20time.%20It%20has%20also%20received%20numerous%20awards%20and%20nominations%2C%20including%20several%20Academy%20Award%20nominations.%0A%0A%2A%